	<section_number>15.2-611</section_number>
	<catch_line>Disability of county manager</catch_line>
	<text>
		In case of the absence or disability of the manager, the board may designate some responsible person to perform the duties of the office.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-313; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-633; 1997, c. 587.</history>
